fonts-cantarell (0.303.1-3) experimental; urgency=medium

  * From version 0.303.1-3 on, the fonts-cantarell package follows
    upstream and switches from providing static fonts (thin, light,
    regular, bold, extrabold) to a single variable font (vf).

    Users who have this font in use during the upgrade (e.g. as the
    standard font in GNOME) may experience visual glitches and will
    have to restart their desktop session immediately after the
    upgrade.

 -- Fabian Greffrath <fabian@debian.org>  Sun, 16 Feb 2025 10:27:22 +0100
